# HOOF-Prints (Bricker et al. 2003), Table 2. The forward primers carry a 5' tail and two reverse
# primers are shared (REV-1 for Locus-2, 7, 8; REV-3 for the rest); REV-3 holds two IUPAC codes.
# The tails do not match the template, so the search needs mismatches: 5 (set in scheme.yml).
# Expected size is the B. abortus 9-941 product measured in GCF_000008145.1.
